    mes "^FF0000The key'alt+end'^000000is ^0087FFShorcut for character Health and SKill Point gauge on / off ^000000.You'd better turn it on all the time."
    mes "^FF0000The key'page up & down'^000000will scroll ^0087FFText in interfaces and the chatting box,Mouse whirl will also scroll^000000."
